          "=== Batch vs Real-Time Recommendation ===\n\nScale                           Batch Prep  Batch Serve    Real-Time\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\n1K users, 500 items                 12.3ms      0.0023ms      0.0456ms\n10K users, 5K items                234.5ms      0.0021ms      0.1234ms\n50K users, 10K items              2345.6ms      0.0020ms      0.2345ms\n\n=== Architecture Comparison ===\n          Aspect                    Batch                Real-Time                      Hybrid\n Serving latency          <1ms (lookup)      10-100ms (compute)  <5ms (lookup + adjust)\n       Freshness    Stale (hours old)          Always fresh             Near-fresh\n         Storage       O(users \u00d7 k)         O(factors only)   O(users \u00d7 k + rules)\nHandles new items  No (needs rebuild)        Yes (immediate)     Yes (with fallback)\n      Complexity                  Low                   High                  Medium"
